{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_04",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:095af0319477a17211c13c199df1bb7cf94bf008426b3c88d196c68b757f6dab",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d1b26bd5c92a44ccc73a2f6710c888e04b746174483db6b045d7f64679e05d4",
      "text": "Sing a song for",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cdcfce3c033f6ee734a55daee616851146b562d69d675763b5b5a192b97783d",
      "text": "男极“制作部门”正式确定举办，\nDRAMATIC STARS将负责把素人制作成\n偶像。而他们要负责的，\n是一位性格有点要强的老爷爷。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_a:cmd-000008:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:851f32e78985f5b441d8d086b8782f09b00f4cc9633468b884231e293ac344f8",
      "text": "第4话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_a:cmd-000008:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d1b26bd5c92a44ccc73a2f6710c888e04b746174483db6b045d7f64679e05d4",
      "text": "Sing a song for",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_a:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0ec3389077892bb515fbb36f84c1ee7da8964be97c706201152a066ddaf1a27",
      "text": "哎呀，男极“速度部门”虽然\n发生了点小插曲，但办得非常成功呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_a:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:709a40fd72a921bd48efda2f85074ccea539e1db194dec43978b405a76f5a334",
      "text": "包括315 Pro在内的小事务所展现出的\n热血羁绊，在节目播出后引发了广泛话题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13650ce640b585b62f9afa175d0e83b596462a1819e1be7b2a1082e6b0cc121c",
      "text": "啊。说到315 Pro，“受欢迎部门”里\nJupiter出演的那期！收视率也相当不错……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a0ddac7ccd82cbe5de6d9770b6ef6a864dd6d75bc7175f6d274665eaf200f92",
      "text": "（这群新面孔事务所。把我的大赛搅得一团乱！\n要是再这样下去……不，等等）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13ccd3bec2d55b970fe3299ce4a70568e3085c0b1ccc69444a4fc6e2b254b67e",
      "text": "（听说315 Pro的偶像们，原本很多人是医生或者律师，\n跟偶像界毫无交集）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_a:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e99c86fd44a9b7b70e30ba0ec0c93056d064e0b89928d6cec8ad1079257a3611",
      "text": "（也就是说……他们对偶像的相关知识，根本就如同门外汉！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_a:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94ff57e77286a503d121125c35284e738553e08e2363f32c7d7a8abe448b0901",
      "text": "（至今为止的表现，绝对是因为有制作人和\n事务所工作人员的辅助！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_a:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f3740b30db81cf40efad25f8ff7226b41406479be0720805b827011da8ea663",
      "text": "（既然如此，要是让偶像自己去\n“制作偶像”的话……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_a:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:867648cdef302886c4de6c26e8945fd7c8077ecc84588e8e2cc9b5694eba1f4a",
      "text": "咳咳。各位，关于下一个主题……\n男极“制作部门”怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_a:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a6eda574ca322b5a678424f1831cd2952c50a81a0071d1646d702fddf6b079d",
      "text": "让偶像把普通人变身为偶像！\n……听起来不是很有趣吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c129c11476133b64e4fe7fdd521e70eb87128b44b81141dd87003eccfcc7ce7f",
      "text": "呜哇～！果然这几件衣服全都超赞的！\n成熟男人的成熟品味，大爆发了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1130a9d02f817fff3f2175badfc5b31e033f3f1126b0ac14be19d00102ea7fa2",
      "text": "时尚又帅气啊！\n不过店看起来很贵，刚进去的时候紧张死了～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_b:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43437c4fa5a09c2458dd697efdd6601caf8da4ca129a3bad6b45b567374a1bfe",
      "text": "我也是我也是！不过店员人很好呢。\n那就是所谓的奢华氛围吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_b:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bae2e93ccff4d92b657067079d51c84ac8a1330688aa9e949cfbe7111b173b8",
      "text": "而且，明明是服装店，却散发着超级好闻的香味！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_b:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fae86b5909fb4b47dd1a653e1df910fe77ddc2ec1407a79a2416f5495702717",
      "text": "在店里的时候，你居然在注意那些东西吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_b:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef9a0983412a513bf0aaa1204c346fd57bc7c292955ff577d4547be6049be107",
      "text": "呵呵。明明从早上开始就走了很多路……\n大家，真有精神呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_b:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2877f65e66903c77dedfd0864827e9bef5f60f115a34d33453f4318ea9974aea",
      "text": "各位，今天谢谢你们\n陪我们一起买东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_b:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8a4b68cd3a6e56a73106ec81129d73dcf196ecb36faabc1886b49b1fb9901f9",
      "text": "多亏你们5个一起过来，帮大忙了。\n托大家的福，买到了适合特番的好服装呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_b:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62e4b2c0a7d789e30828d4b3339997954396d840922117a9acc960402238e0f4",
      "text": "这样一来应该会受现在的年轻人欢迎，\n在制作部门也能拿到高评价了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_b:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2da58f0ed5cad87729a982b7780a958c6f956d41f4f0545b2644234711732ca",
      "text": "剩下的就看老爷爷看到这套服装之后，\n能不能提起干劲了啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_c:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e946ee7afc5792348cc3d0cd8f1a9759fa295390b428724e954955629f26b81b",
      "text": "男极“制作部门”啊。偶像去\n制作偶像，感觉真有意思呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef9d334268516e3b79b77e9c9c3fc963aea4910756f18a78285ad5550caae850",
      "text": "辉先生他们要……制作的，\n是一位老爷爷，对吧……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac2035cfef620ccfbc271d3024fafde7ad8bbf21d62b9e71f30384d8cbd9938e",
      "text": "对。说是快70岁了。\n然后制作部门的特别节目在一个月后。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_c:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fe4cb6ca494ef61f9ddddb6de1d1ad2119490c766529fc48be49fb94ce99d38",
      "text": "好——！我也要去！\n那个特别节目，我们能去现场见学吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_c:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d243a73af0246296f0cc3a89b673ad69875b7497686dee2f7387ad1d6366bd7",
      "text": "大概没问题吧。\n我去问问●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_c:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5e436595c98910d551154e014847f40d6452e1eca84ac4bf893a8aae9e00775",
      "text": "太好啦！\n超级Giga Thank You，翼亲！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_c:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8e22e48fae5c2daf278c4b3870d80456c2c5bd25e7b2b323fd3168a8c7d6ce4",
      "text": "那么，那位老爷爷的进展如何呢？\n一个月后的话，时间也不太充裕吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_c:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d1a60013f900a135770ad59692be8bb6403d171b424a03b6c625318ec70fe89",
      "text": "今天好像是薰先生给他上声乐课来着吧。\n所以才没能来一起买东西……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_c:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d6a68e2fc52e3884788b3b37fb3f6109a049396273aca62c4c3eceabe5a6638",
      "text": "诶！是、是啊，进展嘛，这个……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_c:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1cd97d7d571f68e3c70d9c93a0fe10610c787bd10a3cc43cd751fd9afb9457f",
      "text": "哎呀～……其实，斯巴达式的樱庭，\n和老爷爷的相性稍微有点不太合啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_c:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23744b76f0ea3d09597977e2e045f3587467bb20afe181f7a04382ba32ddf5ea",
      "text": "哈哈……虽然他对我和辉先生的课程，\n态度都还算积极……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_c:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5002e3546d59383c78720f0ae629a442cc3b5eef288a2dac16043aa14d9aaaf2",
      "text": "但跟薰先生在一起就经常起争执呢。\n今天不知道顺不顺利啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_c:cmd-000142:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:793a7a85179ca0894e486fc790e1ec2d01a794bdeea193e3304571bc0af23053",
      "text": "真是的，樱庭这家伙真让人不省心。\n去看看情况吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb8dd0187a7c8671387adbfb8a47d28abce0f4f6fe880ca5a1fd8b75332d9051",
      "text": "辛苦了！\n薰先生，课程进展得怎么样了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_d:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74f8b3194f05459a0ab9edec2a95257949796610015ae416960fd8b2229abadd",
      "text": "高音的延展度不够。\n今天必须练到能唱出来为止。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6889c44b92e7cf1ece8cdd4f9f21a5e8ce1cf732e5b01e6fa6f71d29bb1e287a",
      "text": "啊！？\n别对快70岁的老头子提无理的要求！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52d38144b6a7559a95f947765051b51e99f1b7463e173db8324d8b5b30588819",
      "text": "在做之前就说什么“无理”，\n那不管过多久都解决不了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8cdc99d104bab9dc76302374f6267cd07167eea9cb13db179c5375d7d9de12c5",
      "text": "态度就不能好点吗！你这家伙，\n要是面对自己的父亲也能下这种狠手吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_d:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9409011075b4d42c65894425aa16410c8d248fa502c46807488aab0a799e76a",
      "text": "……呵。\n被你这么一说，我才想起还有父亲这种存在。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_d:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28b6b5b87c5bb2ba0cdd43d34434a4cb7b6785211cf858582229827bdff56f5c",
      "text": "如果你是我父亲，\n我甚至都不会像现在这样跟你扯上关系。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0766b1af89110d1213b0bbd5be7a75c62b1a0eeacdd127f383a35ebb8957cd3d",
      "text": "啊、啊……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_d:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b5f3eeedcec4e5f816c58ce61a916af3602022720fcbc490b04e064a763213b",
      "text": "（……那个人是个“没能拯救”的人。\n我不一样。我……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_d:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74e36fd540a59ca16f2ca11536081e5add1feb14468465c8bb9addbc331e566a",
      "text": "……少废话，继续练习。\n在正式演出前，必须达到完美的水平。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_d:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e886c7e9a2210f4270f57db3375b18ab8c7ceb95f490afa6b3403d1fe51d5f6",
      "text": "那、那个，薰先生。\n要不要稍微休息一下？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_d:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1c20b68b9dabccb0e049cd164a2b0c93924c2bce09920f521ecbb30c163194f",
      "text": "嗯。休息也是练习的一部分。\n老爷爷和薰先生，现在都先休息一下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_d:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7243aec278bd1b63d56cd95cd7df3446bf84cc8fc7dac52771e9e6c8fd77883",
      "text": "哼，那是当然！真是的，\n应付狂妄的小鬼真累人。那我走了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_d:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6f8f41c523d68bb6e91a25cd87093ceed8531e021cba92c15b2bc38555813b4",
      "text": "喂，练习才刚开始啊。\n谁准你擅自决定的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_d:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d7e15bc9ff7932170249a9fb617bde805d23978cac5e38fe8b616323e5c349c",
      "text": "樱庭。对偶像来说，除了“完美”之外\n应该还有更重要的东西吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_e:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0599e45ce933f5f621bda965f8f203b02ed9c16af20564c2584094278f3c834",
      "text": "当然，追求完美也很重要。\n但是啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:259a27ca6edeee9c599396f93171f223a53a661388536f2b5c3e11f1e8b6b2fa",
      "text": "无论面对多么困难的事都全力以赴去完成，\n这种态度本身不就很帅气吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_e:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76a2b190e585e6f170050cf20e6dec3415c28aa7648cd3cbf9802517280860b4",
      "text": "能够切实吸引观众的，是纯熟的技术。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_e:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb7427d892a905ce99459f9b8eae2337222d2a9702891aae404591521b8cf2ae",
      "text": "只有态度积极、却只有半吊子技术的\n偶像，你觉得在别人眼里会有魅力吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_e:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:738ad472a9cb3ae5d5cf6790a8599846933b251db42fd29a75113bc4fe4fcb8c",
      "text": "趁这个机会我就直说了吧。你那种外行想法，\n很可能会阻碍我们的活动。我从很久以前就……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f279d795417f26e950f32627cbb08d0c82295f35a36f49798bd8b9b5c405c241",
      "text": "够、够了……请不要再吵架了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_e:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98739b95ccd71250c93eb093e8d38baf3f898a648b1a0e49967a79cf39a4611a",
      "text": "……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_e:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1d212d3a7f60d4a37abe882c255720b6ce5a499e52fea55791dbf9fb6591f57",
      "text": "重要的难道不是用我们的身姿，\n让看到的人展露笑容吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_e:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1d6935dd401980a8b2fa79e211d5311ccb3a13984bea70766006a7ba3c18e1a",
      "text": "就算歌声和舞蹈表现得再完美……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_e:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b13103205a3ef9c4a9463d82dbd6fcb1cbfbcc0658b632cba41860fc7e84b2ca",
      "text": "如果不能让粉丝们露出笑容的话，\n那样……我认为就没有任何意义……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_e:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30ffe3364615f92ac52c146001de467e533c604a7513484a20bdeb290245e277",
      "text": "大家都先转换一下心情吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_e:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65938970a89131eaba65ce91fc233fcf34c4e898c0754f88122144d73d889509",
      "text": "辉先生和翼先生，\n差不多该前往下一个工作地点了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_e:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df78631a12224202ec0c9d8ab9c0e8124db3d82a61bd7fadb1cea71cf816c4c5",
      "text": "为了让所有人都能冷静下来，稍微休息一下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_e:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2077448065bcc87b0c851db998097cca339bed32836f480e0b3831dcc035932",
      "text": "……好吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_f:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "数小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_f:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e683b797c2f946d6ace33e4a032e72c39ade5c6ae39ad15dcec1e8454ac36dff",
      "text": "声乐课辛苦了。\n接下来是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_f:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86d1fa27d2a6c5ba9f9cdd751c6d86088bd90a49f94934b476f8695a292fe750",
      "text": "我要进行我自己的练习了。\n你可以先回去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_f:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:506b5b2a54998c60744f4dc1991466feffa965efe9014f3c9e6b0a0775c5d777",
      "text": "不，我也继续留在这里。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_f:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe96b413c808e95399e2f3f7b7ae5316c11dbd0893c1e10e51247cbaaa03bbe1",
      "text": "……是吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_f:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68c673cb0bb7234f835779e99ab034d44b4e23ea1e89f39ad1e125bc7f96b460",
      "text": "嗯——、嗯——……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_f:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f475e3c2515f95b625753af167bdd80644f51c98b89ab9fd4676ae7127efcc9a",
      "text": "…………\n“让看到的人展露笑容”，吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_f:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ae563d401510c89e64ef36e736fa333ed63c370ef668eb12d0e60ea4630db61",
      "text": "怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_f:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:876f9cc0f40443e381b6f0f75cd0d9ed35c6c0882a81104f8c3cbcd9e7189b8f",
      "text": "柏木的话，让我想起了小时候的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_f:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aeb6eaa2bb6b82cb6a8eba5177aa06c689898a5e4c8f24c8d33f9317f363b82e",
      "text": "我唱歌的时候，姐姐总是很高兴。\n对我来说，歌声是让姐姐展露笑容的重要之物。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_f:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:056b8905faff8d3640dbeaf2c7ba41732d5b90621a9c3e4cb49d9c1eba6db271",
      "text": "……正因如此，我才想打造出完美的作品。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_f:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7768faea3a1c72c89eb61a2f379ebecf81b099aef71c2fd8be12434e89063fe",
      "text": "姐姐是因为你的歌声很完美，\n才高兴的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_f:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c49ff0c99e5508c935d2d19b6ee0d71d8b87b2dee0e78a66e871fa63fee9987",
      "text": "不……现在的我，歌声要动听得多吧。\n回想起来，那时的音准和节奏都算不上准确。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_f:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8094c4182d00c645f737ed4034392a18e334c3390c40b79aea7577120e404d4f",
      "text": "那时候，我唱的是什么歌来着。记得好像是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_g:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05583fd9687d2c0c798a33ee0bb51c43afaf2e7cb6111a6b91bec16daaea137f",
      "text": "（……很优美的歌声。而且……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_g:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1df07d33e56a148f90d528cc37184d6579f4b9fca64659cb818b5592c4a42a0",
      "text": "唱得很开心呢。\n看着你的我，也忍不住微笑起来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_g:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e472ce03ea7a3c9e7ca12c2771537889391fbb3ca455d5a82379cf43bcf4a87f",
      "text": "真好听的歌呢。\n谢谢你，薰。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_g:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_g:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12c886c6a286f4b19858a8d467e4d6fc560c46e11f77d2221d7671a76d54cd10",
      "text": "薰先生？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_g:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41333327a834ef86654fe9310b78ab732324531742df9530817f74559050dece",
      "text": "喂。\n如果我表现得很开心的样子，姐姐也会……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_g:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55f2953ca673f8cc6d91c3a02a95a48cf06dcae6bb464882b9db653d91ff5d01",
      "text": "……不，这种事已经无法去证实了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_g:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a004a0804490569be9cd1a42d4ab9c6bf408c0364d9f51486a116383cfcf6f72",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n我的笑容，也能让其他人展露笑容吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_g:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0dffb26bbe682986e4667285b977088e8cf2381238e69f50626d919be6cb084e",
      "text": "是的！至今为止，\n您不是也创造了无数的笑容吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_g:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14e4d0ba8302172983e42b02b57163c30215caf1b2ce522f5636632e8bdd8fa1",
      "text": "今后也一定依然会是这样的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_g:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4fdba82449cb7f3ad590af3a993317ab00ce4149ce595111a0d13093d058f93",
      "text": "是吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_g:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2110cbfc50604eeed8d3346e4c166c5356faa61eb322b812bad17992e746b49",
      "text": "但是，我已经想不起当年的笑容是什么样子了。\n……毕竟已经过去10年以上了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_g:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e6c270dee66167f34f7d18cd7f0b077dbe555e7f5541849d04857d755fa8fd4",
      "text": "不好意思，我先去接个电话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_g:cmd-000115:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62f025ec421e33d3e29782615b3469190e245c9f9a389adab71890c9e7b116ae",
      "text": "喂，我是柏木。因为工作提前结束了，\n我现在正准备回练习室。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_g:cmd-000118:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ece6c1710e9d1c50a4fa80c9a503f41438cc7aee7ed871eedb46744d539b0f9b",
      "text": "那个……薰先生的情况怎么样了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_g:cmd-000120:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08d1ef0111525db10ae1f6c86bd4a985abdd8cfac8d83528eee2b99ae69b07ba",
      "text": "刚才的我，\n情绪可能有点太激动了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_g:cmd-000122:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f0197ede2e0cc00989713309abeb75708cb4740abb7c798a6a723173b2d436d",
      "text": "所以，一想到会不会让薰先生\n感到不愉快……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_g:cmd-000124:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e68930474d0a838a0ebbc7bfe705d65fcb0eca3cbb1c06bf704e7a11c87751d3",
      "text": "薰先生的话，\n没问题的哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_g:cmd-000127:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:154508d2e19cd61bd092a0f8d4a20aca93bbad5e1a3560f8710f8ccb724430d7",
      "text": "真的吗？太好了……啊，对了。\n我现在和辉先生在一起。我把电话给他哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_g:cmd-000131:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fff1c53c283f111f078f348ba322825aa9ca71f275d823da7e38649d76940128",
      "text": "哟，●●●●プロデューサー。那个……我也刚好\n提前把工作搞定了，就跟翼汇合了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_g:cmd-000133:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:532d3df61d51698f911af3882dba63ae061fa1b7d5bd09646c5ff261339e4c21",
      "text": "老爷爷的课程应该差不多结束了，不过按照樱庭那性格，\n是不是又留下来加练了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_g:cmd-000135:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:206476b7f7a2b0d3e61c55038200fa20cc6d83deb122205b1cf422fd126f6b8c",
      "text": "只有翼和●●●●プロデューサー在的话，\n应付那家伙会很吃力吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_g:cmd-000137:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81eea03e6169eefd26690781b3c248d842f6d9f88c051ec9d708ecb87c5f3ef9",
      "text": "所以，我也回练习室去。那就这样，\n一会儿见啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_h:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8926f25a9604e69cdeb60e530b52e464ed3acca3f3ec50016a22580d0fd4b1c",
      "text": "是辉先生和翼先生打来的。\n两位说现在就回这边来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_h:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:672535aba6f48a360aefb1021bf72e405152585c770f2c2aa4804c41eb880d06",
      "text": "八成是担心应付我的你会吃不消吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_h:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec64253e3af9c92d01e6fe641145745017884a91bad18452474cccec89b5a79d",
      "text": "只要别来碍事就行。\n我继续练习了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_h:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:620161bb35129e953c0edd213286e8957af1d73b39dec931f76aa0c755216c00",
      "text": "薰先生，在那之前能耽误您一点时间吗？\n是关于刚才的话题……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_h:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd8d7afcd1995dec0328d8808c9782e10612ebe279974105611f2a4eff48080c",
      "text": "就算薰先生想不起来，\n也有很多人期盼着薰先生的笑容。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_h:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebac58e2d687d173932aaedc2f420ea58eb0eded5e13f1d1c9f051d67cb92dc9",
      "text": "辉先生、翼先生，还有我也是。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_h:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ba2a3ad3fae34dd0d04ae3b842828217275cd251c910bdac72a4ffcb79afbd6",
      "text": "……你们？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_h:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53d1ef1084d731df7400cf747fa4fd6240fa5e70104307052dbfbca5cfc44eb9",
      "text": "是的！所以一定会有那么一天，\n让您在不知不觉中笑逐颜开。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_h:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:290e37dc4295b0429a2bfe9d27735b2f198fa3ffa2487432667156ea7e489b3a",
      "text": "在那一天到来之前，\n我会一直为薰先生做好制作的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_h:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff8f58a2f95701b9422f18de765bfbbbebd9455cae748e52ef73a072d080b17f",
      "text": "（……还能再次迎来那样的一天吗……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_i:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e3d44ce4ab378f12f6818c50b044caa6ccf57794b257df93e817c8dccafd42e",
      "text": "特番当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_i:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bc7d196cbbdb243546c37c3a7c3b1afa0ddb056a7867a822bfb758e46070d1b",
      "text": "非常感谢！完全看不出是位快70岁的老人，\n真是无比美妙的歌声呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_i:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:390b04545d23d5e52a66aebd2466331dae01dec1fc6d33d1b235e36237cef7d3",
      "text": "对吧！？鞭策这把老骨头还是值得的！\n收看的各位观众，也谢谢你们啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_i:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56ad5ea0de939bb0c9b81d95f71294a2c82b88864c74e8b3b0cf123402a747a1",
      "text": "老爷爷完全很有偶像范儿呢！\n笑容显得闪闪发光。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_i:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4e24f328149ca34d42e730b8dd4daec2ed37c6636f8a4bfcd1ee3554d4988ef",
      "text": "就是说啊……真希望我们到了\n60、70岁的时候，也能像那样闪闪发光啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_i:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04727c9d392753072b1f50286e12b05eeb96001d16505f0f194040be58527699",
      "text": "嗯，你说得对。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_i:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:858953e0fc32ca7c69dfa98e534f4a826ccd87f7748b50f693f65a0d88c33d90",
      "text": "哎……搞什么，难得见你这么坦率啊。\n我还以为你肯定会嫌弃呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_i:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c54e9abe7deaa17120f6f6881ac9a064a6e7100898a4b3870cb41a78bc27ac60",
      "text": "身为偶像如果不能时刻散发光芒，\n我的目标也没法实现吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_i:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:492f805d505b1b4a965bd409db94c953fc18673bd4f380159416da7d28cadaac",
      "text": "哪怕活到60、70岁，跟你们一起继续闪闪发光……\n也未尝不可。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_i:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:339d79dc9053232571db4f1d191ffc1643f00aeab0b14e641cbce4500d7954c2",
      "text": "（如果这能与我的笑容、粉丝的笑容……\n以及姐姐的笑容相连的话）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_j:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bd69be1bbc07dde404301c2c2e66efe28f3c67936aaa997a37086762d5b5cbb",
      "text": "那么，在本次“制作部门”中大显身手的\n这几位，也请为我们献上舞台表演吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_j:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e3c0bf6f10821763260a78da132eea21bb0e01389f6926e3161fc416ea0e16f",
      "text": "他们就是DRAMATIC STARS的各位！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_j:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d7cb0bd52805db5d9f74c0feae4ac93654c259078bae80b87ad694baba17411",
      "text": "接下来轮到我们来热场子了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_j:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:320a3f3b5432e359ede6a7e9b649739affc5d9b1878c6f4c65bc4b78de46599e",
      "text": "身为偶像的前辈，可得拿出能让老爷爷心服口服的\n舞台给他瞧瞧啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_j:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00d1c585d77ac0f5254e51e40dddceefa9ab298d16866e04f448bf73b7e59c63",
      "text": "我们也会为了带给大家笑容而努力的。\n和可靠的伙伴、辉先生还有薰先生一起！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_j:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75149aa1767e6dbcdad4d3d3525d4011b31199d52e8b55ff794ae0ba799895cd",
      "text": "（……现在，唯有歌唱。直到传达至那些逝去的岁月）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_j:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17a14eff9819ab6486607724d38e058b01340f8bb2f46dda39b410f5a8d57617",
      "text": "（DRAMATIC STARS的表演一开始，\n演播室内的热情就越来越高涨……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_j:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc1397124f7a4aa7ca6b2e3a8a123ac873ccb21fd9d2312eb8b49091800a4748",
      "text": "刚才那段舞，太炸了吧！\n三个人不是配合得天衣无缝嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_j:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9a9315807902af958ecf49e8f4131739687d8a1ea7aed54eb5533feb572ccde",
      "text": "唱歌也好厉害啊。在指导老爷爷的同时，\n他们自己居然也练到了这种水准吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_j:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc3b536235eeb37cec30c307aec697685827637c554ecebf9b0474cf5f406bb1",
      "text": "而且……看起来，非常开心呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_j:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:792c9aa9cdf3c6b9b24d577510891f8b9d8786c4d97cf89172af5237b7d38512",
      "text": "没毛病！3个人都活力四射，\n帅得闪瞎眼啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_j:cmd-000159:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfa31194962c09097a37a008913a3b2cd8c8f28a1d3dd13edbd1b22c4e0a2a8f",
      "text": "……真好啊，DRAMATIC STARS。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_04:1_4_002_04_j:cmd-000171:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2b95626fffbc0edec1e0398833f80f3a85e257048a89485a3024a65129b0eeb",
      "text": "我高中毕业成了大人以后，\n也想跟他们一样，一直一直那样闪闪发光啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
